// the FILE_X data tables: graphics, terrain and interface art
//
// upstream numbers the Graphics and Interfac enums by DRS file index, so
// those enums are sparse. the ids here are dense and 0-based with the drs
// index as a column. Terrain is dense upstream and keeps its numbering.
//
// the NONE rows carry real column values upstream, so row 0 of each table
// holds them and the accessors index with id + 1.

// --------------------------------------------------------------- graphics

